  "content": "Week 15: Unitree Go2 & Many Hackathons\n\nHackathons\n\nThis week, there are three hackathons. Next.js global hackathon, Microsoft hack the future, and a google one. One thing to note that american companies are so rich. Many tools are able to use freely, so next week I will dig deep to these tools.\n\nUnitree Go2\n\nI attended EEVR meetup in TalTech. And I saw the Unitree Go2 CyberDog. It did look like a real dog. But hard to think why would it be a commercial success.",
